{"title":"The Sun King","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">The Sun King is a named <a href=\"#/monster/mummy\">Mummy</a> seen at level 50.</p>\n      <h2>Wearing</h2><p></p><div class=\"gear-line\"><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>head</i> Gold Head</span><span class=\"gear-piece\"><i>main hand</i> Gold Scimitar</span></div>\n      \n      <h2>Where to find The Sun King</h2>\n      <ul class=\"wp-list\"><li>Inside <b>Sun King&#39;s Tomb</b> <span class=\"muted\">· seen 3×</span> <button type=\"button\" class=\"open-zone\" data-zone=\"-195\">Layout</button></li></ul>\n      \n      \n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"npc\" data-map-id=\"the-sun-king\">Show on map</button>\n      <h2>Drops</h2><p class=\"muted\">No drops recorded for The Sun King yet.</p>\n      <h2>Other named Mummys</h2><p><a href=\"#/npc/the-hollow-herald\">The Hollow Herald</a></p>\n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic\"><img src=\"data/img/96e8c6ee6ef952f035d5.webp\" alt=\"\"></div><h3>The Sun King</h3><table>\n      <tr><th>Kind</th><td><a href=\"#/monster/mummy\">Mummy</a></td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Level</th><td>50</td></tr>\n      <tr><th>Hitpoints</th><td>909</td></tr><tr><th>Seen</th><td>3 times</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}